Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:02.83,Opening,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:01.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1572,498)}Planet Tian Yun\NAlliance Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Tian Yun's spiritual energy is so dense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it's overflowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Suzaku is not even comparable to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many powerful cultivators must live on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,To avoid being found out as an Ancient God,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,my original body will stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,There seems to be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,some kind of destructive energy in this mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I recklessly charge in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will attack me relentlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Senior All-Seer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master has been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never told anyone where I was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that Senior All-Seer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,possesses divination abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and calculated my arrival today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.56,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(394,429)}Heavenly Fate Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin of planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,requests an audience with Senior All-Seer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:18.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1494,523)\fad(300,300)}Zhao Xingsha\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,this person is just an honorary disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,why do you want him to take the trials ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, I took him as disciple on a whim
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it created a seed of karma for our relation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that in just 100 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,he would've already reached this stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,He isn't simple...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has good fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to have caught Master's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he passes the 3 trials,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,take him to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(453,523)\fad(300,300)}Zhou Wan\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is a native from a wasted planet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,worthy of Master's teachings ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master values talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this Wang Lin is extraordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,taking him as a disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Sun Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seems Master has really lost all faith in you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.04,0:04:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you want to see Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll have to undergo the 3 trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you dare to try ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Human Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,tests the Dao Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:26.29,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(258,438)}Human Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Dao Heart tested ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it uses the heart's desires
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to manifest illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,But how does one pass the Human Trial ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This trial isn't difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether you calm your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,or slash through the illusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,the trial will be cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know what Sun Yun did back then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He chose to seek the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Yun became Master's direct disciple of the Purple Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many geniuses like Sun Yun are there in this world ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:24.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it just the two of you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will you be safe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,many people from the village are going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we're lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,we might even get a roe deer pelt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.64,0:05:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you carving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,What am I carving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only remember
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it was something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.64,0:06:01.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want to let go of this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.12,Second,,0,0,0,,Something's happened !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,A tiger has killed people !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,They were fine when they left...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did this happen ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Human Trial is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:32.95,Second,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each time my wood carving breaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cycle starts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the cycles are endless...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,they leave me in the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you have seen through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,why didn't you break the illusion to come out ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't build without breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break it and recreate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Major destruction leads to major creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dawn is a metaphor of rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rebirth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:01.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's old ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's new ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:07.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 84th cycle is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to continue ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This child
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is really good...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Human Trial that I made
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,may be called a trial
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,but is in reality an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If one seeks the Dao during the trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Dao Heart will become indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Yun only sought of the Dao for 67 days back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,this child is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:07:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The true meaning of the Human Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to seek the Dao with your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Being yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and not fearing your true heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not rejecting your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the true meaning of freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(391,448)}Earth Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the guardian of the Earth Trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you may continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that the number of guardians I can defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,is used to gauge the strength of my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone's been spying on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,These Earth Trial and Heaven Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,might be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I give up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Earth Trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dared to continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would've used this opportunity to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,At least now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've lost your qualification to become a disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:46.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(395,445)}Heaven Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Trial
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,tests the domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:57.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I got so far
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,by making a domain with a small part of a heavenly Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I was able to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can the All-Seer manifest the root of that heavenly Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of power does he possess ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I don't want this experience
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to sabotage my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I give up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Zhao Xingsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I entered the sect earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,you may call me Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master has instructed me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,to guide you to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,how many disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,does Senior All-Seer have ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Master's disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all categorized by 7 colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just our Purple Division
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,has over a million disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Purple Division of the Heavenly Fate Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among the 7 divisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Purple Division is the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will understand why
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,go west from here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will find it easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have important things to do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I won’t accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:51.96,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1176,520)}Purple Cloud Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(418,526)}Jin Ye\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple\NEarly stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Lin, a new disciple of the Purple Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master instructed me to live in the Purple Cloud Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram ! Don't take a single step
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,within 100 li from the Purple Cloud Pavilion !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,She dares to deny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,the All-Seer's order ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, you have been away for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're trying to take your Purple Cloud Pavilion now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as long as I am here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not let it happen !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone tried to sabotage me within the 3 trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't pass them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,but was still allowed into the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the Purple Cloud Pavilion is guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the All-Seer's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,he must know all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he chooses to stand by and watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that means he is still testing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1703,651)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who dared to make a cave
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,without an Elder's permission ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come out now !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are the Purple Division's Disciplinary Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have one incense stick of time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to destroy this cave !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:22.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the cave is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still violated the sect's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come with us now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will decide your punishment !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've picked the wrong person to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to cultivate in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I cannot endure your provocations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you attack a Disciplinary Elder ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seven Broken Stars !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandson, stand still for your grandpa !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll slice your head off !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:23.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,A madman...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's a madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who used to live in the Purple Cloud Pavilion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,1000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,a peerless genius appeared in the Purple Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,His name was Sun Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,he lived in the Purple Cloud Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 years ago, after he betrayed the sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Purple Cloud Pavilion became vacant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does this Sun Yun have to do with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Master has always taken a single direct disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,from each one of the 7 divisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're the only ones that will receive his true teachings
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and are called the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master once said that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the next person that lives in the Purple Cloud Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,will become a Son of Tian Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's why everyone's been so hostile towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...I've told you everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,please spare my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since waiting here is useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will turn this place upside down
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to let everyone know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I am not someone to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,this pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.24,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(226,527)}Purple Forest Pavilion\NHeavenly Fate Sect\NPurple Division
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:51.28,Pavilion,,0,0,0,,{\fad(000,300)\pos(974,209)}Purple Forest Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall be renamed Purple Forest Pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:51.20,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: The "Lin" in "Wang Lin" is the character for "forest".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,kill you !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're just a fool that's being manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop it !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected, they've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 Middle stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and 1 Late stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:09.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(397,569)}Zhao Xinmeng\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you just entered the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you have already killed Fifth Sister ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you have harmed a fellow disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,no need to waste words with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will clean up the sect for Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you're the one that interfered
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're a native from a wasted planet !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before you die, let me show you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,what a real spell looks like !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:32.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forbidden spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal Demonic Body !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demonic Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:55.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,possess such a spell ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,What an overbearing finger spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:04.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's just an arrogant Junior that shows no respect for Elders !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just entered the sect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I've encountered so many obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is not a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only one who could orchestrate disciples and Elders
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,so seamlessly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is Senior Brother worried that I'll become one of the Seven Sons of Tian Yun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:33.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're doing all this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't spout nonsense !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this thing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a formidable Heavenly Beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I saw you on planet Suzaku back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said I'd take you as an honorary disciple for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, I have changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to become my disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cultivate the great Dao of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will you become the direct disciple of the Purple Division ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must have had a demonic cultivator beside you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:04.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,which has tainted you with his demonic aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple knows someone like that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we've parted ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,In my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's no distinction between righteous, evil, immortal and demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,One only needs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,to follow their natural desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heavenly fate, heavenly fate !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything in the world depends on fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as you have a Dao Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can cultivate any of the infinite Daos that exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple will remember your teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will celebrate my birthday in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.68,0:19:45.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take the opportunity to announce I accepted you as my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivators of planet Tian Yun have profound cultivation and spells...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The relations in the sect are complex...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:58.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's far more dangerous than Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even though the All-Seer has accepted me as his disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must not let my guard down
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,against the Purple Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:20.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:26.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:32.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:38.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:43.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:49.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:49.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.32,0:20:55.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:55.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:59.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:02.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:06.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:11.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:11.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:17.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:23.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:23.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:26.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:28.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
